      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "The Kalgoorlie Cup now and OPPORTUNISTIC (2) has returned in top order, winning fresh before a 0.8L defeat in the Boulder Cup leading into this. He jumped favourite there and gets a big weight swing in his favour today. Has options from the barrier and can go one better. LILLIAN (8) was just fair in the Boulder Cup but should be better again out to this trip now. She comes in with no weight on her back and Fiore can put her to sleep in a midfield position. Wouldn't surprise to see her explode now and claim the Kalgoorlie Cup. THE JESTER'S SON (3) rounded up his rivals to win the Boulder Cup in readiness for this, scoring by 0.8L. Drawn better this time out in trip now and he can repeat the dose without surprising. ALL GRUNT (4) is on the quick turnaround here after a much better run out in trip last start. Can improve again now. CITINO (5) is right in this on his latest form after a strong performance in the Boulder Cup.",
